                                                                                                                        CPC1035N
                                                                                          4 Pin SOP OptoMOS® Relay




                   CPC1035N            Units          Description
  Load Voltage       350                V             The CPC1035N is a miniature 1-Form-A solid state relay
  Load Current       100                mA            in a 4 pin SOP package that employs optically coupled
  Max RON             35                Ω             MOSFET technology to provide 1500V of input to output
                                                      isolation. The efficient MOSFET switches and photovolta-
                                                      ic die use Clare’s patented OptoMOS® architecture. The
                                                      optically coupled input is controlled by a highly efficient
Features                                              GaAlAs infrared LED. The CPC1035N uses Clare’s state
• Small 4 Pin SOP Package                             of the art double molded vertical construction packaging
• Low Drive Power Requirements (TTL/CMOS              to produce the world’s smallest relay. The CPC1035N
  Compatible)                                         offers board space savings of at least 20% over the com-
• No Moving Parts                                     petitor’s larger 4 pin SOP relay.
• High Reliability
• Arc-Free With No Snubbing Circuits
• 1500VRMS Input/Output Isolation                     Approvals
• FCC Compatible                                      • UL/C-UL Recognized Component
• No EMI/RFI Generation                                 File #: E76270
• Machine Insertable, Wave Solderable                 • BSI CERTIFIED - CERTIFICATE #: 8416
• Tape & Reel Version Available                         (EN60950)


